<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Duet Lyrics - By You">
  <meta property="og:description" content="A sweet duet with male and female verses.">
  <title>Duet Lyrics</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: #333;
    }
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .verse {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .male {
      background-color: #e0f0ff;
      border-left: 6px solid #2196f3;
    }
    .female {
      background-color: #ffe0f0;
      border-left: 6px solid #e91e63;
    }
    .chorus {
      background-color: #f0f0f0;
      font-style: italic;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        padding: 1rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>🎵 Duet Song Title</h1>

  <div class="verse male">
    <strong>Male:</strong>  
    <p>I saw you standing by the light,<br>
    The world just faded out of sight.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="verse female">
    <strong>Female:</strong>
    <p>I felt your gaze across the air,<br>
    A silent whisper said you care.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="chorus">
    <p>Together we dance in the rhythm of stars,<br>
    Hearts aligned, no matter how far.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="verse male">
    <strong>Male:</strong>
    <p>I tried to speak but words would stray,<br>
    Your smile just took my breath away.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="verse female">
    <strong>Female:</strong>
    <p>I waited long for you to see,<br>
    That you and I were meant to be.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="chorus">
    <p>Together we sing, one voice, one song,<br>
    In this melody, we both belong.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
